    "encoding_note": "CANopen defines no line code; the bits on the wire are CAN (NRZ + bit stuffing). The CANopen-level encodings are the COB-ID allocation (predefined connection set keyed on the Node-ID), the object dictionary index/sub-index addressing, the PDO mapping entries (index/sub-index/length), the PDO transmission types, and the NMT command specifiers."
